  "remarks": "\nFarzanegan Propulsion Systems Design Bureau (FPSDB) is an involved person within the meaning of the Iran (Sanctions) Regulations 2023 on the basis of the following ground: FPSDB is or has been involved in hostile activity by the Government of Iran, namely carrying on business in the Iranian defence sector.\n",
